  <section class="hr-section">
    <h2>A law that keeps slowing</h2>
    <p>A power law grows quickly at first and more slowly later, but at a steady rate in the right units: the exponent should be the same whatever stretch you fit. Fit the hash rate from three starting years and the exponent falls each time.</p>
